    "description": "The Telecom SIM Verification API enables businesses to verify the authenticity of SIM cards in bulk efficiently. By utilizing this endpoint, organizations can submit a batch of SIM card information for validation, ensuring that the SIM cards are legitimate and properly activated. This functionality is essential for telecom providers and enterprise clients seeking to prevent fraud and ensure customer satisfaction. Typical use cases include onboarding new users or managing existing accounts while maintaining a high level of service integrity.",
